"body":"Just in case if it does help with this issue then consider these as a suggestion:\r\n\r\n- My [ASSIMP Viewer](https://githubdragonfly.github.io/viewers/templates/ASSIMP%20Viewer.html), which is a ASSIMP(JS) / three.js hybrid, cannot show either of the DAE models\r\n- My [DAE Viewer](https://githubdragonfly.github.io/viewers/templates/DAE%20Viewer.html), which is three.js based, can show both DAE models but can also:\r\n  - re-export to DAE format, which makes the file 3 times bigger but readable by the ASSIMP Viewer\r\n  - export to some other format (GLB is approximately the same size as the original DAE)\r\n\r\nIn case if you would like to experiment, both of the exports are attached below.\r\n\r\nJust to point out that DAE Exporter used on my end might be obsolete.\r\n\r\n[cr-c75u2-close-combat - DAE Export.zip](https://github.com/assimp/assimp/files/12707041/cr-c75u2-close-combat.-.DAE.Export.zip)\r\n[cr-c75u2-close-combat - GLB Export.zip](https://github.com/assimp/assimp/files/12707042/cr-c75u2-close-combat.-.GLB.Export.zip)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/comments/1732380547/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/comments/1741809862","html_url":"https://github.com/assimp/assimp/issues/5234#issuecomment-1741809862","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/5234","id":1741809862,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAnkjM5n0ejG","user":{"login":"nathaneltitane","id":5674757,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NzQ3NTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5674757?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathaneltitane","html_url":"https://github.com/nathaneltitane","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathaneltitane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use